    "tier 'candidate' = excluded from the proposed label space (see 'reason'); counts are still reported.",
    "approximate=true = label names differ between datasets; inspect the contact sheets before accepting the mapping.",
    "Set a folder to null when the class does not exist in that dataset. A list gives aliases (e.g. PlantWild v1 and v2 names).",
    "Folder names are matched case-insensitively, ignoring underscores, commas and repeated spaces.",
    "Every PlantVillage and PlantDoc folder is mapped; unmapped PlantWild folders are crops or diseases outside the label space."
